  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2901.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-11-09",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2901.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to reduce emissions of sulfur dioxide (SO2) and nitrogen oxides (NOx) by establishing:\n\n(a) New Hampshire’s SO2 and NOx annual budget trading and banking program;\n\n(b) The method for allocating allowances under that program; and\n\n(c) The requirements for emissions monitoring, recordkeeping, reporting, and automatic deduction of allowances to offset excess emissions.\n\nSource. #7888, eff 5-13-03; ss by #9908, INTERIM, eff 5-13-11, EXPIRES: 11-9-11; ss by #10002, eff 10-1-11; ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a2900.html"
